        "text": "Flora, who was ten, tugged on her seat belt. Her sister, eight-year-old Daisy, bounced in her seat. \"Are we really flying back to Grandma's?\" Daisy asked for the tenth time. Flora rolled her eyes, but she was excited too. Grandma lived in New York, and it felt like forever since they'd seen her. Even Dad seemed happy, humming a little tune.",
